 "remarks": "Welcome to 182 W Norwalk Road, Norwalk, CT!  Set in the sought-after West Norwalk area, this property offers a wonderful opportunity to create your ideal home in a convenient and established residential setting. The location provides a peaceful suburban atmosphere while keeping you close to everything Norwalk has to offer, including shopping, dining, parks, schools, transportation, and major commuting routes.  Surrounded by established homes and mature landscaping, West Norwalk is known for its attractive residential neighborhoods and convenient proximity to both Norwalk and neighboring communities. Whether you're looking to make this property your next home, update and customize an existing residence, or explore its potential, 182 W Norwalk Road presents an excellent opportunity.  Enjoy the best of Norwalk living with easy access to downtown amenities, the Merritt Parkway, I-95, Metro-North transportation, and the nearby communities of Darien and New Canaan.  A great opportunity in a desirable West Norwalk location-come see the possibilities at 182 W Norwalk Road!",
